        {
          "text": "Na lĩu wa Solomoni wa mũthenya ũmwe waĩ ithimi mĩongo ĩtatũ sya mũtu mũvinyu, na ithimi mĩongo thanthatũ sya mũtu ũte mũvinyu, ",
